data: {"text":"1. THAT this Rent Agreement is executed between the Landlord and the"}

data: {"text":" Tenant for the demised premises being Flat No. 304, 3rd Floor, Sunshine Apartments, Boring Canal Road, Patna - 800001, measuring 1100"}

data: {"text":" sq. ft., which is a furnished residential flat comprising two bedrooms, one hall, kitchen, two bathrooms, and one balcony.\n\n2. THAT the Landlord hereby"}

data: {"text":" grants to the Tenant the right to use and occupy the said premises for a period of 11 months commencing from 15.05.2"}

data: {"text":"026 and ending on 14.04.2027, strictly for residential purposes only.\n\n3. THAT the monthly rent for the said premises shall be Rs. "}

data: {"text":"22,000/- (Rupees Twenty Two Thousand only) which shall be paid by the Tenant to the Landlord on or before the 5th day"}

data: {"text":" of every month during the subsistence of this agreement.\n\n4. THAT the rent shall be paid by the Tenant through bank transfer to the Landlord's HDFC Bank"}

data: {"text":" account, the details of which have been provided separately, and the Tenant shall retain proof of such"}

data: {"text":" payment for record purposes.\n\n5. THAT the Tenant has paid a security deposit of Rs. 66,000/- (Rupees"}

data: {"text":" Sixty Six Thousand only) to the Landlord at the time of execution of this agreement, which amount shall be refundable to the Tenant upon vacating the premises, subject"}

data: {"text":" to deductions for any damages, unpaid dues, or breach of terms hereof.\n\n6. THAT the"}

data: {"text":" monthly rent shall be subject to an annual escalation of 8% with effect from the completion of each year of"}

data: {"text":" tenancy, and such escalated rent shall be payable from the subsequent month onwards"}

data: {"text":".\n\n7. THAT the demised premises shall be used strictly for residential purposes by the Tenant for self and immediate family members only, and no"}

data: {"text":" commercial, professional, or business activity of any nature shall be conducted therefrom.\n\n8. THAT"}

data: {"text":" the Tenant shall not sub-let, assign, or part with the possession of the demised premises or any portion thereof to"}

data: {"text":" any third party without the prior written consent of the Landlord, and any such unauthorized sub-letting shall constitute a breach of this agreement.\n\n9. THAT the Tenant shall be responsible for payment"}

data: {"text":" of electricity charges, water charges, and society maintenance charges pertaining to the demised premises during the period of tenancy, and shall"}

data: {"text":" produce receipts of such payments to the Landlord when demanded.\n\n10. THAT all major"}

data: {"text":" structural repairs and maintenance of the building shall be borne by the Landlord, while minor repairs and day"}

data: {"text":"-to-day maintenance of the demised premises shall be the responsibility of the Tenant.\n\n11. THAT the Tenant shall not make any structural alterations, additions, or modifications to the demised"}

data: {"text":" premises without the prior written consent of the Landlord, and shall maintain the premises in good condition throughout the tenancy period.\n\n12. THAT either party may terminate this agreement by giving "}

data: {"text":"2 months prior written notice to the other party, and upon such termination, the Tenant shall peacefully hand over vacant possession of the premises to the Landlord."}

data: {"text":"\n\n13. THAT in case of default in payment of rent for a period exceeding 15 days from"}

data: {"text":" the due date, the Landlord shall have the right to terminate this agreement and take possession of the premises after giving reasonable notice to the Tenant.\n\n14"}

data: {"text":". THAT the Tenant, being a salaried employee of HDFC Bank, has provided employment details and"}

data: {"text":" salary certificates to the Landlord as proof of financial capacity to honor"}

data: {"text":" the obligations under this agreement.\n\n15. THAT neither party shall be liable for any delay or failure"}

data: {"text":" in performance of their obligations under this agreement if such delay or failure is due to force majeure events including but not limited to natural calamities, government"}

data: {"text":" orders, or circumstances beyond reasonable control.\n\n16. THAT any dispute arising out of or in connection with this agreement shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the competent courts at"}

data: {"text":" Patna, and the parties agree to resolve disputes through mutual consultation failing which through legal"}

data: {"text":" proceedings.\n\n17. THAT this agreement shall be executed in the presence of two witnesses who shall attest the same"}

data: {"text":", and both parties acknowledge having read, understood, and agreed to all the terms and conditions contained herein.\n\n18. THAT this"}

data: {"text":" agreement constitutes the entire understanding between the parties and supersedes all prior negotiations, representations, or agreements relating"}

data: {"text":" to the subject matter hereof, and any modification shall be valid only if made in writing and signed by both parties."}

